      "en": "They will see his face, and his name will be on their foreheads.",
      "ko": "그의 얼굴을 볼터이요 그의 이름도 저희 이마에 있으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "895a06c28b3f743bae3748b99a69b90fe4a25fddde48f8872ce499db80d1f748",
      "translation_text_hash": "0c91b1896a2911900727e003f1b54dbcfa284989ff94107504f53f9d82b5cd9d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
