      "en": "He said to me, “Don’t seal up the words of the prophecy of this book, for the time is at hand.",
      "ko": "또 내게 말하되 이 책의 예언의 말씀을 인봉하지 말라 때가 가까우니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e969dac2b8f92ac947912f78833de29d3dff9fa17425febb3b03a56cfb27781a",
      "translation_text_hash": "7bbdc50657bb285a669ade5777e7ebe749257f9fbd8d7f21e94770a06961ed99",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
