      ],
      "en": "Blessed are those who do his commandments,that they may have the right to the tree of life, and may enter in by the gates into the city.",
      "ko": "그 두루마기를 빠는 자들은 복이 있으니 이는 저희가 생명 나무에 나아가며 문들을 통하여 성에 들어갈 권세를 얻으려 함이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "520d91203422a2f724cccd3a66d790ab477f83139fb13efdef266fd3c797744d",
